   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What moving to Creao changed",
   "originalText": "What moving to Creao changed",
   "fontSize": 26,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "e53",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2162,
   "y": 236.5,
   "width": 516,
   "height": 318.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 991070208,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 648200382,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. The helpers now live outside our backend, so the\nbackend needs a locked door they can call through.\n2. A helper run takes minutes, so the app shows\nprogress instead of an instant answer.\n3. Our backend keeps a list of the runs it started and\ndouble-checks every \"done\" message, because Creao\ndoesn't sign them.\n4. The helper instructions move from files in our code\nto saved helpers in Creao.\n5. Creao's credits pay for the AI in those helpers, so\nthey no longer need our own AI key.\n6. Creao keeps a copy of each run, which is one more\nreason helpers only ever see ids.\n7. New: helpers can run on a schedule overnight, so the\nowner's list is ready by morning.",
   "originalText": "1. The helpers now live outside our backend, so the\nbackend needs a locked door they can call through.\n2. A helper run takes minutes, so the app shows\nprogress instead of an instant answer.\n3. Our backend keeps a list of the runs it started and\ndouble-checks every \"done\" message, because Creao\ndoesn't sign them.\n4. The helper instructions move from files in our code\nto saved helpers in Creao.\n5. Creao's credits pay for the AI in those helpers, so\nthey no longer need our own AI key.\n6. Creao keeps a copy of each run, which is one more\nreason helpers only ever see ids.\n7. New: helpers can run on a schedule overnight, so the\nowner's list is ready by morning.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
